Sinead%20Mulhern%20traded%20birthday%20parties%20with%20friends%20for%20a%20quiet%20retreat%20in%20Ecuador.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EShe%20spent%20her%2035th%20birthday%20alone%2C%20hiking%20to%20a%20mountaintop%20overlooking%20Peru.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHer%20solo%20retreat%20left%20her%20feeling%20more%20grounded%2C%20rested%2C%20and%20hopeful%20for%20the%20future.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EEarlier%20this%20year%2C%20I%20took%20a%20solo%20birthday%20trip%20for%20the%20first%20time%2C%20and%20I%20turned%2035%20on%20top%20of%20a%20mountain%20looking%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthings-wish-i-knew-before-visiting-peru-frequent-traveler-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eviews%20of%20Peru%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20the%20distance.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThough%20it%20felt%20a%20little%20counterintuitive%2C%20I%20now%20recommend%20a%20birthday%20trip%20alone%20%E2%80%94%20not%20every%20year%2C%20but%20at%20least%20once.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20year%20had%20felt%20very%20start-and-stop.%20By%20April%2C%20my%20birthday%20was%20around%20the%20corner%2C%20and%20there%20was%20no%20arguing%20that%20somehow%2C%20to%20my%20surprise%2C%20I%20was%20now%20undeniably%20in%20my%20mid-30s.%20I%20both%20wanted%20to%20pause%20to%20celebrate%20the%20life%20I've%20built%20%E2%80%94%20the%20one%20where%20I%20get%20to%20live%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flung-collapsed-travel-hiking-adventure-pneumonia-hospital-ecuador-south-america-2024-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ework%20from%20Ecuador%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20while%20also%20taking%20stock%20of%20what%20may%20lie%20ahead.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20mind%20had%20been%20a%20busy%20place%2C%20buzzing%20with%20what-ifs%2C%20shoulds%2C%20and%20mentally%20preoccupied%20with%20the%20landscape%20of%202026%2C%20which%20feels%20shaky%20at%20best.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20not%20much%20of%20a%20planner%2C%20and%20with%20enough%20on%20my%20mind%20already%2C%20I%20decided%20to%20skip%20party%20planning%2C%20sit-down%20dinners%20I%20don't%20typically%20enjoy%2C%20or%20a%20logistically-heavy%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftook-international-scotland-trip-friends-mistakes-lessons%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Egetaway%20with%20friends.%3C%2Fa%3E%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Deck%20chairs%20looking%20out%20to%20the%20mountain.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a729916f9ea6266446ee683%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223213%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EShe%20spent%20her%20solo%20trip%20getting%20a%20massage%2C%20eating%20delicious%20food%2C%20and%20hiking%20up%20a%20mountain.%3Cp%3EProvided%20by%20Sinead%20Mulhern%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2264c551d7-f98a-487c-a360-57e878f31f29%5C%22%3EI%20took%20myself%20on%20a%20retreat%20to%20the%20mountains%20%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20spent%20five%20days%20in%20a%20mountain%20valley%20in%20southern%20Ecuador%2C%20a%20few%20hours%20from%20where%20I've%20been%20living%20and%20working%20as%20a%20freelance%20writer%20for%20eight%20years.%20I%20did%20as%20I%20pleased%3A%20reading%20in%20hammocks%2C%20getting%20a%20massage%20and%20facial%2C%20eating%20delicious%20food%2C%20and%20hiking%20up%20a%20mountain.%20All%20by%20myself.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20a%20glance%2C%20these%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsolo-travel-tips-for-long-haul-trips%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esolo%20travel%20plans%3C%2Fa%3E%20may%20have%20paled%20in%20comparison%20to%20past%20birthdays.%20Back%20when%20I%20lived%20in%20Canada%2C%20I%20threw%20larger-than-life%20parties.%20Other%20years%2C%20I%20celebrated%20with%20adventures%3A%20chasing%20waterfalls%20through%20the%20Amazon%20for%20my%2030th%2C%20dancing%20salsa%20until%20dawn%20in%20the%20Colombian%20countryside%2C%20or%20trekking%20to%20a%20volcano.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20this%20year%20called%20for%20something%20more%20subdued%3A%20time%20away%2C%20alone%2C%20in%20nature%2C%20and%20appreciating%20the%20quiet.%20Anyone%20who%20has%20never%20taken%20a%20trip%20like%20this%20must.%20I%20can't%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftraveled-solo-for-decade-best-tips-make-friends-stay-safe-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Erecommend%20solo%20travel%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20on%20one's%20birthday%2C%20no%20less%20%E2%80%94%20enough.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20the%20time%20I%20arrived%20in%20the%20chill%2C%20bohemian%20town%20of%20Vilcabamba%20in%20Ecuador's%20south%2C%20I%20had%20a%20list%20of%20books%20to%20catch%20up%20on%2C%20trekking%20gear%20ready%2C%20and%20spa%20appointments.%20I%20knew%20full%20well%20that%20I%20was%20reaping%20the%20benefits%20of%20being%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwoman-chose-solo-travel-over-motherhood-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%20travel-minded%20and%20childfree%3B%20%3C%2Fa%3Edecisions%20I%20made%20in%20my%2020s.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwoman-living-abroad-ecuador-slow-down-esmeraldas-latin-america-2025-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EEcuadorian%20town%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20one%20I%20know%20well.%20It's%20the%20kind%20of%20place%20where%20balmy%20afternoons%20give%20way%20to%20heavy%20rain.%20Afterward%2C%20rainbows%20stretch%20across%20the%20valley.%20It's%20so%20beautiful%20and%20the%20perfect%20place%20to%20pause%20and%20take%20stock%20from%20a%20lazily%20swinging%20hammock.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20hiking%20trail%20in%20Ecuador%20with%20a%20view%20of%20Peru.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a7298874327cd5a0ae2e2a0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223213%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EHer%20birthday%20hike%20led%20to%20a%20view%20of%20Peru.%3Cp%3EProvided%20by%20Sinead%20Mulhern%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2289f1a4a9-a04d-422a-860e-02aea60be75f%5C%22%3EOn%20my%20birthday%2C%20I%20climbed%20a%20mountain%20%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20day%20was%20so%20hot%20that%20each%20step%20I%20took%20left%20a%20puffy%20cloud%20of%20dust.%20I%20hiked%20past%20bushes%20of%20fuchsia%20flowers%20and%20an%20overgrown%20part%20of%20the%20trail%20where%20hummingbirds%20darted%20between%20the%20trees.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESteadily%2C%20I%20climbed%20toward%20the%20top%2C%20wondering%20what%20the%20second%20half%20of%20my%2030s%20would%20hold.%20I%20planned%20for%20more%20travel%20%E2%80%94%20be%20it%20on%20my%20own%20like%20I%20was%20there%2C%20or%20surrounded%20by%20friends%20and%20family%20as%20I%20often%20am%20%E2%80%94%20especially%20in%20this%20area%20of%20the%20world%2C%20which%20I've%20fallen%20in%20love%20with.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20vowed%20to%20do%20more%20creative%20work%2C%20writing%2C%20and%20purpose-driven%20projects.%20I%20crossed%20my%20fingers%20that%20my%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Folder-parents-aging-anxiety-challenges-benefits-2025-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eparents%20would%20age%20slowly%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20happily%2C%20that%20friends%20who%20opted%20for%20parenthood%20wouldn't%20drift%20too%20far%2C%20that%20the%20world%20might%20stabilize%2C%20and%20that%20I%20would%20find%20a%20deeper%20purpose%20in%20it.%20It%20was%20a%20rather%20long%20wish%20list%20for%20a%20relatively%20short%20and%20breathless%20climb.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThis%20particular%20mountain%20has%20a%20steep%20trail%20to%20the%20top%2C%20marked%20by%20a%20cross.%20By%20the%20time%20I%20neared%20the%20peak%2C%20I%20was%20thirsty%20and%20a%20little%20sunburned.%20Still%2C%20I%20persisted%20to%20beat%20the%20afternoon's%20probable%20storm.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20reached%20the%20top%2C%20orange%20butterflies%20floated%20above%20the%20slopes%20of%20the%20mountain.%20I%20breathed%20the%20sweet%20grassy%20scent%20and%20stared%20at%20the%20village%20below.%20Off%20in%20the%20distance%2C%20rows%20of%20crinkly%20mountain%20ridges%20stretched%20on%20for%20miles.%20I%20recognized%20I%20was%20looking%20at%20Peru.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222316%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20woman's%20face%20wearing%20a%20dark%20top.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a7291a0f9ea6266446ee66f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223088%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAt%2035%2C%20Mulhern%20feels%20settled%20in%20Ecuador.%3Cp%3EProvided%20by%20Sinead%20Mulhern%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228a0a4450-3ee1-47f7-baef-61c73ed54045%5C%22%3EMy%2020s%20brought%20me%20to%20South%20America%20%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fremote-work-colombia-digital-nomad-lifestyle-toronto-housing-2023-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EI%20left%20Toronto%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20follow%20a%20gut%20feeling.%20I'm%20so%20thankful%20I%20dreamt%20large%20and%20took%20that%20risk.%20At%2035%2C%20I'm%20settled%20in%20Ecuador.%20I%20write%2C%20read%2C%20study%2C%20and%20live%20an%20active%20lifestyle.%20I%20also%20refuse%20to%20miss%20any%20of%20the%20country's%20iconic%20fireworks%20and%20thrive%20amid%20the%20bold%20energy%20this%20part%20of%20the%20world%20is%20famous%20for.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20pendulum%20swings%20between%20excitingly%20chaotic%20and%20practical%20%E2%80%94%20a%20word%20my%20mom%20often%20uses%20and%20one%20I%20hated%20until%20recently.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20was%20ready%2C%20I%20headed%20back%20down%20the%20mountain%20past%20a%20brambly%20forest%20of%20bushes.%20The%20transition%20from%20young%20to%20youngish%20feels%20strange.%20There's%20so%20much%20I%20want%20to%20pack%20into%20my%20life%2C%20and%20markers%20of%20time%2C%20such%20as%20birthdays%2C%20can%20feel%20like%20reminders%20that%20time%20is%20moving%20on%20for%20both%20me%20and%20those%20I%20love.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20to%20have%20the%20lifestyle%20and%20independence%20to%20take%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww