c%2Fs%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fus-says-southern-route-through-strait-of-hormuz-remains-free-and-open-11866881%2Famp%2F1%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fus-says-southern-route-through-strait-of-hormuz-remains-free-and-open-11866881%2Famp%2F1%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22SpaceX%20says%20it%E2%80%99s%20coming%20for%20AT%26amp%3BT%2C%20Verizon%2C%20and%20T-Mobile%20customers%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228192%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Gwynne%20Shotwell%20of%20SpaceX%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a727db73f00ff875d13cd07%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224096%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ESpaceX%20President%20Gwynne%20Shotwell%20said%20she%20expects%20to%20take%20some%20customers%20from%20the%20Big%203%20wireless%20carriers%20as%20it%20upgrades%20Starlink%20Mobile.%3Cp%3EMichael%20Nagle%2FBloomberg%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ESpaceX's%20Starlink%20Mobile%20provides%20cellular%20coverage%20in%20dead%20zones%20and%20during%20network%20outages.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20company%20has%20plans%20to%20turn%20Starlink%20Mobile%20into%20a%20full-fledged%20wireless%20carrier.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ESpaceX%20President%20Gwynne%20Shotwell%20said%20next-gen%20satellites%20will%20boost%20Starlink%20Mobile's%20coverage.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ESpaceX%20wants%20to%20turn%20Starlink%20Mobile%20into%20a%20full-fledged%20mobile%20carrier%2C%20and%20it%20expects%20to%20hit%20the%20Big%20Three%20wireless%20giants%20in%20the%20process.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDuring%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fspacex-first-earnings-report-spcx-stock-lockup-period-expiration-2026-8%23space-x-loves-the-government-and-airlines%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESpaceX's%20first%20earnings%20call%3C%2Fa%3E%20since%20its%20June%20IPO%2C%20President%20Gwynne%20Shotwell%20said%20the%20company%20plans%20to%20launch%20its%20next-generation%20Starlink%20Mobile%20satellites%20in%202027%20and%20start%20providing%20an%20upgraded%20service%20by%20the%20end%20of%20that%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20network%20would%20use%20the%20extra%20wireless%20capacity%20%E2%80%94%2065%20megahertz%20of%20spectrum%20%E2%80%94%20that%20the%20company%20agreed%20to%20acquire%20from%20EchoStar.%20Shotwell%20said%20the%20result%20would%20be%20%26quot%3B100%20times%20better%26quot%3B%20than%20Starlink%20Mobile's%20current%20service.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShotwell%20also%20namedropped%20the%20three%20dominating%20wireless%20carriers%20in%20the%20US%20%E2%80%94%20AT%26amp%3BT%2C%20Verizon%2C%20and%20T-Mobile%20%E2%80%94%20and%20said%20Starlink%20will%20provide%20a%20better%20service.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20anticipate%20us%20to%20be%20able%20to%20acquire%20quite%20a%20few%20of%20their%20customers%20because%20I%20think%20our%20service%20will%20be%20better%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felon-musk-spacex-starlink-emergency-services-free-on-cell-phones-2024-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EStarlink%20Mobile%3C%2Fa%3E%20currently%20acts%20mostly%20as%20a%20satellite%20safety%20net%20for%20phone%20carriers.%20The%20company's%20satellites%20operate%20like%20cell%20towers%20in%20space%2C%20connecting%20phones%20when%20on-the-ground%20service%20is%20unavailable%2C%20including%20in%20remote%20areas%20or%20emergency%20situations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20the%20US%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstarlink-t-mobile-dead-zones-satellite-cell-service-spacex-2025-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ET-Mobile%20partners%20with%20SpaceX%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20provide%20satellite-to-cellular%20connectivity%20through%20a%20service%20branded%20as%20T-Satellite.%20The%20service%20isn't%20a%20full%20substitute%20for%20a%20standard%204G%20or%205G%20plan.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20T-Mobile%20spokesperson%20pointed%20to%20comments%20made%20by%20CEO%20Srini%20Gopalan%20during%20the%20company's%20second-quarter%20earnings%20call%20in%20July.%20Gopalan%20said%20satellite-to-cell%20service%20is%20complementary%20to%20traditional%20networks%2C%20as%20it%20accounted%20for%200.0003%25%20of%20T-Mobile's%20network%20usage%20during%20the%20busiest%20summer%20months.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESpaceX%20said%20it%20also%20plans%20to%20build%20a%20terrestrial%20network%20alongside%20its%20satellite%20system.%20Shotwell%20said%20on%20the%20call%20that%20the%20company%20could%20deploy%20lower-cost%2C%20smaller%20cellular%20base%20stations%20with%20Starlink%20dishes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felon-musk%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESpaceX%20CEO%20Elon%20Musk%3C%2Fa%3E%20said%20the%20resulting%20network%20would%20provide%20better%20connectivity%20and%20higher%20bandwidth%20%26quot%3Bthan%20what%20is%20currently%20available%20from%20cellular%20providers.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BInstead%20of%20having%20to%20deploy%20these%20very%20expensive%20and%20difficult-to-locate%2C%20large%20cellular%20base%20stations%2C%20we%20feel%20reasonably%20confident%20that%20we%20can%20deploy%20a%20large%20number%20of%20small%20stations%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20May%2C%20the%20Federal%20Communications%20Commission%20approved%20the%20transfer%20of%20EchoStar%20spectrum%20to%20SpaceX%2C%20opening%20the%20opportunity%20for%20SpaceX%20to%20use%20it%20for%20satellite%2C%20terrestrial%2C%20or%20hybrid%20applications.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShotwell%20declined%20to%20disclose%20the%20project's%20capital%20costs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESpokespeople%20for%20Verizon%20and%20AT%26amp%3BT%20did%20not%20respond%20to%20a%20request%20for%20comment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fspacex-starlink-mobile-satellite-tmobile-verizon-att-competition-q2-earnings-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785891308000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22ht