-revokes-brazil-ambassadors-visa-in-spat-with-lula-da-silva-11866868%2Famp%2F1%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ndtv.com%2Fworld-news%2Fus-revokes-brazil-ambassadors-visa-in-spat-with-lula-da-silva-11866868%2Famp%2F1%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22AMD%20executives%20say%20the%20chip%20company%20has%20a%20key%20advantage%20over%20Nvidia%3A%20being%20more%20open%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224248%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22AMD%20CEO%20Lisa%20Su.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a72696bf9ea6266446ee60e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222889%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAMD%20CEO%20Lisa%20Su.%3Cp%3EI-Hwa%20Cheng%20%2F%20AFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EAMD%20embraces%20open-source%20as%20a%20strategy%20to%20compete%20with%20Nvidia%20in%20the%20AI%20chip%20market.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAMD%20partnered%20with%20OpenAI%20and%20Anthropic%20to%20leverage%20open-source%20ROCm%20for%20AI%20chip%20programming.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAMD's%20stock%20fell%209%25%20in%20late%20trading%20after%20it%20reported%20earnings.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famd-ai-vp-gpu-shortage-nvidia-lock-in-2024-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAMD%3C%2Fa%3E%20says%20it%20has%20a%20major%20advantage%20in%20the%20AI%20chip%20race%20against%20Nvidia%3A%20being%20more%20open.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAMD%20has%20long%20promoted%20this%20strategy%20through%20its%20open-source%20ROCm%20software%2C%20used%20to%20program%20AI%20chips.%20Since%20ROCm%20is%20available%20as%20open%20source%2C%20it's%20free%20for%20anyone%20to%20use%2C%20download%2C%20or%20modify.%20On%20the%20company's%20earnings%20call%20on%20Tuesday%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famd-lisa-su-ceo-nvidia-competition-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAMD%20CEO%20Lisa%20Su%3C%2Fa%3E%20said%20this%20software%20is%20at%20an%20%26quot%3Binflection%20point%2C%26quot%3B%20with%20open-source%20contributions%20up%2010%20times%20in%20the%20past%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETwo%20AMD%20executives%20spoke%20with%20Business%20Insider%20in%20July%2C%20prior%20to%20earnings%2C%20about%20how%20making%20some%20of%20the%20company's%20major%20software%20and%20hardware%20products%20open-source%20gives%20the%20company%20a%20leg%20up%20over%20companies%20such%20as%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnvidia-backs-loans-for-neoclouds-gmi-cloud-expands-ai-infrastructure-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ENvidia%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20Qualcomm.%20In%20particular%2C%20they%20see%20this%20approach%20as%20an%20advantage%20over%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnvidia-cuda-new-threats-ai-coding-agents-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECUDA%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Nvidia's%20software%20that%20runs%20on%20its%20AI%20chips%20and%20is%20widely%20considered%20a%20moat.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere's%20a%20reason%20for%20this%2C%20the%20executives%20say%3A%20it%20helps%20AMD%20cheaply%20tap%20into%20the%20skills%20and%20contributions%20of%20thousands%20of%20engineers%20to%20develop%20its%20software%20faster%20in%20a%20red-hot%20AI%20race.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20power%20of%20the%20open%20source%20community%20is%20just%20unprecedented%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Kirk%20Saban%2C%20corporate%20vice%20president%20of%20product%2C%20software%2C%20and%20solutions.%20%26quot%3BYou%20can%20tap%20into%20all%20of%20those%20developers%2C%20and%20they're%20essentially%20doing%20free%20development%20work%20for%20us.%20They're%20upstreaming%20code%20into%20our%20code%20base%2C%20and%20you're%20leveraging%20the%20best%20and%20brightest%20minds%20in%20the%20industry.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAMD%20says%20its%20latest%20chips%20are%20the%20best%20for%20AI%20agents%2C%20largely%20because%20developers%20can%20improve%20the%20software%20through%20open-source%20contributions%2C%20said%20Salil%20Raje%2C%20senior%20vice%20president%20of%20AMD's%20adaptive%20and%20embedded%20computing%20group.%20He%20called%20open%20source%20%26quot%3Ba%20central%20pillar%20in%20our%20strategy.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20believe%20in%20getting%20the%20ecosystem%20to%20work%20with%20us%2C%20and%20we%20will%20use%20the%20same%20kind%20of%20strategy%20in%20the%20physical%20AI%20and%20robotic%20space%2C%26quot%3B%20Raje%20said.%20%26quot%3BIn%20fact%2C%20the%20reason%20agentic%20AI%20works%20for%20our%20platform%20better%20than%20maybe%20the%20competitors'%20platform%20is%20because%20our%20software%20is%20out%20in%20the%20open%20now.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EChip%20companies%2C%20including%20AMD%2C%20have%20seen%20some%20volatility%20in%20the%20stock%20market%20lately%2C%20with%20a%20massive%20sell-off%20in%20late%20July.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20they%20have%20rebounded%2C%20AMD's%20stock%20was%20down%209%25%20in%20late%20trading%20on%20Tuesday%20after%20it%20reported%20earnings.%20Revenue%20came%20in%20at%20%2411.5%20billion%2C%20beating%20analysts'%20expectations.%20Capital%20expenditures%20nearly%20tripled%20to%20%24808%20million%2C%20compared%20to%20the%20previous%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20companies%20seek%20out%20more%20compute%20to%20power%20their%20AI%20systems%2C%20they've%20increasingly%20turned%20to%20AMD%20as%20an%20alternative%20to%20Nvidia.%20AMD's%20stock%20is%20up%20about%20193%25%20in%20the%20past%20year%2C%20while%20Nvidia%20has%20gained%20roughly%2020%25.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3EHave%20a%20tip%3F%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Cem%3E%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20via%20email%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Armchan%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Ermchan%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20%3Cem%3Eor%20Signal%20at%20rosal.13.%20Use%20a%20personal%20email%20address%2C%20a%20nonwork%20WiFi%20network%2C%20and%20a%20nonwork%20device%3B%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finsid