949.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Brittany%20Mahomes%20reaffirmed%20her%20support%20for%20women's%20sports%20during%20the%20launch%20of%20KC%20Current%20Studios%2C%20saying%20the%20stories%20of%20female%20athletes%20deserve%20to%20be%20shared.%20The%20Kansas%20City%20Current%20co-owner%20highlighted%20the%20confidence%2C%20inspiration%20and%20opportunities%20sports%20create%20beyond%20competition.%20Her%20comments%20came%20amid%20ongoing%20debates%20surrounding%20women's%20sports%2C%20while%20Patrick%20Mahomes%20showed%20his%20support%20by%20reacting%20to%20the%20club's%20family%20post%20on%20social%20media.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22GLOBAL%20SPORTS%20DESK%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A100%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22These%20are%20the%20AI%20world's%20biggest%20questions%20as%20the%20White%20House%20hashes%20out%20a%20framework%20with%20OpenAI%2C%20Google%2C%20and%20Anthropic%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224559%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Donald%20Trump%20gestures%20while%20sitting%20with%20OpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%20and%20Google%20DeepMind%20CEO%20Demis%20Hassabis.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a724562f9ea6266446ee326%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223039%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOpenAI%20CEO%20Sam%20Altman%20and%20Google%20DeepMind%20CEO%20Demis%20Hassabis%20sit%20alongside%20President%20Donald%20Trump%20in%20June.%3Cp%3ELudovic%20Marin%20%2F%20AFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EOpenAI%2C%20Anthropic%2C%20and%20Google%20met%20in%20D.C.%20on%20Tuesday%20to%20assess%20Trump's%20AI%20model%20review%20framework.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EPresident%20Donald%20Trump's%20administration%20plans%20to%20review%20AI%20models%20for%20cybersecurity%20risks.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20framework%20challenges%20Trump's%20light-touch%20AI%20regulation%20stance%20amid%20rapid%20technology%20advances.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20AI%20world%20is%20looking%20to%20D.C.%20for%20clarity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Tuesday%2C%20staffers%20from%20OpenAI%2C%20Anthropic%2C%20Google%2C%20and%20other%20tech%20companies%20convened%20in%20Washington%20to%20review%20the%20administration's%20new%20framework%20for%20reviewing%20advanced%20AI%20models.%20Now%2C%20the%20rest%20of%20the%20industry%20eagerly%20awaits%20answers%20on%20what%20will%20be%20included%20in%20the%20framework%20%E2%80%94%20a%20structured%20way%20for%20President%20Donald%20Trump's%20administration%20to%20evaluate%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmetr-beth-barnes-ai-talent-shortage-safety-research-openai-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20models'%20cyber%20capabilities.%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20framework%20represents%20a%20turning%20point%20for%20AI%20oversight.%20While%20Trump's%20administration%20has%20adopted%20a%20light-touch%20regulatory%20approach%2C%20rapid%20advances%20in%20AI%20models%20for%20cybersecurity%20and%20hacking%20are%20beginning%20to%20upend%20it.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20an%20open%20question%20how%20the%20new%20process%20will%20shape%20up%20and%20affect%20the%20release%20and%20adoption%20of%20new%20AI%20models.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nytimes.com%2F2026%2F08%2F04%2Ftechnology%2Fwhite-house-ai-framework.html%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EThe%20New%20York%20Times%3C%2Fa%3E%20reported%20on%20Tuesday%20that%20White%20House%20officials%20said%20at%20the%20meeting%20that%20the%20federal%20government%20plans%20to%20review%20only%20certain%20types%20of%20AI%20models%20from%20companies%20like%20Anthropic%20and%20OpenAI%20for%20potential%20security%20risks%20and%20does%20not%20plan%20to%20review%20open-source%20AI%20models%20so%20far%2C%20though%20these%20plans%20could%20change%20as%20the%20technology%20advances.%20Open-source%20models%20allow%20anyone%20to%20download%20or%20modify%20the%20code%20for%20free.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAn%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-signs-scaled-back-ai-executive-order-anthropic-mythos-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eexecutive%20order%20in%20early%20June%3C%2Fa%3E%20directed%20officials%20to%20develop%20a%20%26quot%3Bbenchmarking%20process%20to%20assess%20the%20advanced%20cyber%20capabilities%20of%20AI%20models%26quot%3B%20within%2060%20days.%20The%20deadline%20has%20passed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20are%20the%20major%20outstanding%20questions.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d90dd549-5073-44db-b985-56c3766d7200%5C%22%3EHow%20committed%20is%20the%20Trump%20administration%20to%20its%20stance%20on%20AI%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20administration's%20AI%20oversight%20approach%20has%20been%20defined%20by%20its%20light-touch%20regulatory%20stance.%20Its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrump-admin-plans-block-funding-states-with-strict-ai-laws-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20Action%20Plan%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20released%20in%202025%2C%20said%20that%20regulation%20might%20end%20up%20%26quot%3Bparalyzing%26quot%3B%20the%20industry%2C%20and%20called%20on%20agencies%20to%20%26quot%3Bdismantle%20unnecessary%20regulatory%20barriers%20that%20hinder%20the%20private%20sector.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20executive%20order%20in%20June%20acknowledged%20a%20new%20reality%20in%20which%20AI%20models%20from%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-anthropic-staff-plan-for-ipo-financial-windfalls-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAnthropic%20and%20OpenAI%20%3C%2Fa%3Ehave%20shown%20marked%20improvements%20in%20coding%2C%20finding%20cybersecurity%20exploits%2C%20and%20working%20on%20longer-term%20tasks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20framework%2C%20as%20sketched%20in%20the%20June%20order%2C%20will%20require%20companies%20to%20share%20their%20AI%20models%20with%20the%20government%20for%20up%20to%2030%20days%20before%20releasing%20them%20to%20the%20public%2C%20giving%20the%20government%20a%20head%20start%20in%20assessing%20their%20cyber%20capabilities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECrucially%2C%20Trump's%20executive%20order%20described%20the%20framework%20as%20%26quot%3Bvoluntary%2C%26quot%3B%20though%20it's%20an%20open%20question%20how%20the%20administration%20would%20treat%20companies%20that%20skip%20the%20process.%20Jessica%20Ji%2C%20an%20analyst%20at%20Georgetown's%20Center%20for%20Security%20and%20Emerging%20Technology%2C%20said%20it%20seems%20like%20officials%20are%20trying%20to%20create%20a%20%26quot%3Bsoft%20compliance%20regime.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIdeally%2C%20they%20can%20say%20we're%20not%20regulating%2C%20this%20is%20a%20voluntary%20program%2C%20but%20all%20of%20the%20companies%20whose%20models%20they%20think%20present%20potential%20national%20security%20risks%20would%20comply%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224e93b170-aac9-4e7e-a840-77b42aaddd6f%5C%22%3EWhich%20AI%20models%20will%20the%20framework%20cover%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3ERegulating%20AI%20is%20tricky.%20Rules%20could%20target%20the%20top-tier%20labs%2C%20specific%20products%2C%20or%20individual%20AI%20models.%20If%20regulators%20home%20in%20on%20the%20models%2C%20more%20questions%20pop%20up.%20Do%20they%20base%20their%20rules%20on%20the%20models'%20size%2C%20or%20when%20they're%20released%2C%20or%20what%20they're%20capable%20of%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20conversation%20in%20D.C.%20over%20recent%20months%20has%20turned%20around%20the%20AI%20models'%20capabilities%20because%20of%20new%20developments%20like%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Feverything-we-know-about-tom-brown-anthropic-white-house-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAnthropic's%20Mythos%20model%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20OpenAI's%20security%20incident%20with%20the%20AI%20company%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhugging-face-ceo-clem-delangue-openai-rogue-agent-hack-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EHugging%20Face%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETrump's%20executive%20order%20asked%20his%20agencies%20to%20develop%20a%20definition%20of%20the%20%26quot%3Bcovered%20frontier%20models%26quot%3B%20that%20would%20be%20vetted%20by%20his%20administration.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbiggest-winner-from-cheap-chinese-ai-silicon-valley-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EChinese%20open-source%20and%20open-weight%20models%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20have%20sparked%20furor%20in%20the%20industry%20recently%20because%20of%20their%20advanced%20capabilities%2C%20are%20almost%20certainly%20part%20of%20the%20Tuesday%20conversation%2C%20Ji%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20added%20that%20figuring%20out%20ways%20to%20categorize%20AI%20models%20is%20a%20crucial%20step%20for%20the%20rulemakers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22da82f204-7d9e-41db-be9c-b29d6807418b%5C%22%3EWhat%20authority%20will%20the%20government%20have%20over%20the%20leading%20AI%20juggernauts%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20unclear%20so%20far%20how%20the%20framework%20will%20affect%20the%20rollout%20of%20AI%20models%2C%20especially%20if%20it%20truly%20feels%20voluntary%20to%20companies.%20Ji%20said%20she's%20curious%20whether%20there%20will%20be%20any%20clear%20guidance%20on%20what%20the%20administration%20can%20do%20if%20it%20finds%20a%20dangerous%20capability%20while%20testing%20unreleased%20technology.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20June%2C%20Trump's%20Commerce%20Department%20responded%20to%20cybersecurity%20concerns%20about%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhy-white-house-ordered-export-controls-anthropic-mythos-fable-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAnthropic%20model%3C%2Fa%3E%20by%20issuing%20an%20export%20control%20that%20barred%20the%20company%20from%20granting%20foreign%20nationals%20access.%20Anthropic%20ended%20up%20pulling%20down%20all%20access%20to%20the%20model%20until%20it%20reached%20a%20deal%20with%20the%20administration.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EJi%20said%20it's%20unlikely%20the%20administration%20would%20keep%20resorting%20to%20export%20controls%2C%20though%20it's%20unclear%20what%20other%20levers%20they%20might%20pull%20to%20intervene%20in%20a%20model%20release%20or%20to%20pressure%20a%20company%20to%20change%20its%20product.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20said%20the%20meeting%20will%20provide%20more%20clarity%20on%20who%20in%20the%20Trump%20administration%20makes%20the%20decisions%20around%20AI%20oversight%20and%20cybersecurity.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe're%20trying%20to%20figure%20out%20who%20are%20the%20new%20kind%20of%20power%20players%2C%20who%20has%20influence%20in%20the%20administration%20on%20this%20set%20of%20issues%2C%20right%20now%2C%26quot%3B%20Ji%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic%2C%20Google%2C%20and%20OpenAI%20did%20not%20immediately%20respond%20to%20requests%20for%20comment%20from%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EHave%20a%20tip%3F%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20via%20email%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Ascouncil%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Escouncil%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%2C%20or%20over%20text%2C%20Signal%2C%20Telegram%2C%20or%20WhatsApp%20at%20415-757-8198.%20Use%20a%20personal%20email%20address%2C%20a%20nonwork%20WiFi%20network%2C%20and%20a%20nonwork%20device%3B%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finsider-guide-to-securely-sharing-whistleblower-information-about-powerful-institutions-2021-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3E%3Cu%3Ehere's%20our%20guide%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%20to%20sharing%20information%20securely.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-google-and-anthropic-white-house-meeting-biggest-questions-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785885986000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a724562f9ea6266446ee326%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22o