the-job-you-would-take-if-you-didnt-need-a-job-and-timeless-career-advice%2Famp_articleshow%2F132873266.cms%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fquote-of-the-day-by-warren-buffett-look-for-the-job-you-would-take-if-you-didnt-need-a-job-and-timeless-career-advice%2Famp_articleshow%2F132873266.cms%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22OpenAI%20reaches%20%243.2%20million%20settlement%20with%20DOJ%20over%20claims%20it%20discriminated%20against%20US%20workers%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222500%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22OpenAI%20sign%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a3154e267d7cff2f5b9bb19%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221668%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOpenAI%20said%20it%20disagreed%20with%20the%20Justice%20Department's%20findings%20but%20wanted%20to%20move%20ahead.%3Cp%3ESeongJoon%20Cho%2FBloomberg%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20Justice%20Department%20said%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhistory-of-openai-company-chatgpt-elon-musk-founded-2022-12%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EOpenAI%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20a%20subsidiary%20discriminated%20against%20US%20workers.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOpenAI%20disputes%20the%20findings%20but%20will%20pay%20%243.2%20million%20to%20settle%20the%20claims.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdonald-trump%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ETrump%3C%2Fa%3E%20administration%20has%20sought%20to%20crackdown%20on%20companies%20it%20sees%20as%20abusing%20the%20visa%20process.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Justice%20Department%20said%20OpenAI%20and%20one%20of%20its%20subsidiaries%20discriminated%20against%20US%20workers%20by%20unfairly%20favoring%20workers%20with%20temporary%20visa%20status%20during%20the%20hiring%20process.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Tuesday%2C%20the%20Justice%20Department%20announced%20that%20OpenAI%20and%20Statsig%2C%20a%20subsidiary%20software%20development%20company%20based%20in%20Bellevue%2C%20Washington%2C%20would%20pay%20%243.2%20million%20to%20settle%20the%20allegations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20is%20illegal%20to%20discriminate%20against%20U.S.%20workers%20by%20preferring%20temporary%20visa%20holders%20for%20jobs%2C%26quot%3B%20Assistant%20Attorney%20General%20Harmeet%20K.%20Dhillon%20said%20in%20a%20statement.%20%26quot%3BThis%20substantial%20settlement%20ensures%20that%20OpenAI%20redresses%20harm%20and%20changes%20its%20recruitment%20practices%20so%20that%20U.S.%20workers%20receive%20a%20fair%20opportunity%20for%20highly%20sought-after%20technology%20positions.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20said%20it%20disagreed%20with%20the%20DOJ's%20findings%2C%20but%20settled%20the%20matter%20so%20it%20could%20move%20forward%20with%20a%20program%20to%20support%20employees%20%26quot%3Brequiring%20immigration%20support.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOpenAI's%20mission%20is%20to%20ensure%20that%20AGI%20benefits%20all%20of%20humanity%2C%26quot%3B%20an%20OpenAI%20spokesperson%20said%20in%20a%20statement.%20%26quot%3BFulfilling%20that%20mission%20and%20maintaining%20America's%20leadership%20in%20AI%20requires%20attracting%20and%20retaining%20the%20best%20talent%20from%20the%20United%20States%20and%20around%20the%20world.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhile%20we%20disagree%20with%20the%20DOJ's%20findings%2C%20we%20reached%20this%20agreement%20to%20resolve%20the%20matter%20and%20move%20forward%20with%20our%20PERM%20program%2C%20which%20is%20critical%20for%20employees%20and%20candidates%20requiring%20immigration%20support.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Justice%20Department%20said%20it%20found%20%26quot%3Breasonable%20cause%26quot%3B%20to%20believe%20that%20both%20companies%20made%20it%20more%20difficult%20for%20US%20workers%20to%20apply%20for%20positions%20they%20hoped%20to%20fill%20with%20foreign%20workers%20through%20Permanent%20Labor%20Certification%2C%20a%20process%20known%20as%20PERM.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Trump%20administration%20has%20sought%20to%20crack%20down%20on%20companies%20it%20has%20said%20are%20abusing%20the%20visa%20system.%20The%20PERM%20program%20allows%20companies%20to%20sponsor%20temporary%20visa%20holders%20for%20permanent%20status%2C%20but%20only%20if%20they%20cannot%20find%20US%20workers%20for%20the%20job%20following%20a%20good-faith%20recruitment%20effort.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20DOJ%20said%20OpenAI%20and%20Statsig%20failed%20to%20take%20several%20steps%20critical%20to%20the%20PERM%20process%2C%20including%20failing%20to%20post%20some%20jobs%20on%20external%20sites%20and%20not%20advertising%20the%20positions%20on%20the%20radio%20late%20at%20night.%20OpenAI%20also%20required%20applicants%20for%20jobs%20it%20hoped%20to%20fill%20via%20PERM%20recruitment%20to%20mail%20in%20paper%20applications%2C%20even%20though%20it%20usually%20allowed%20electronic%20applications%20for%20other%20positions%2C%20the%20DOJ%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20total%2C%20the%20Justice%20Department%20said%2C%20while%20there%20were%20fewer%20than%2010%20positions%20at%20issue%20across%20both%20OpenAI%20and%20Statsig%2C%20%26quot%3Bthe%20resolution%20amount%20reflects%20the%20harm%20to%20US%20workers%20when%20they%20are%20shut%20out%20of%20applying%20for%20lucrative%20technology%20jobs.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOf%20the%20%243.2%20million%20settlement%2C%20OpenAI%20will%20pay%20%241.2%20million%20in%20civil%20penalties.%20The%20other%20%242%20million%20is%20being%20set%20aside%20to%20establish%20a%20fund%20%26quot%3Bto%20compensate%20victims%20of%20the%20companies'%20discriminatory%20practices.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-doj-settlement-hiring-us-workers-perm-program-visas-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785875783000%2C%22visual%2