%20to%20pay%20Warner%20Bros.%20Discovery%20shareholders%20more%20than%20%241%20billion%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fparamount-delayed-wbd-deal-david-ellison-lawsuit-ticking-fee-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eso-called%20ticking%20fees%3C%2Fa%3E%20after%20a%20federal%20judge%20set%20the%20date%20for%20the%20trial%20about%20its%20merger%3A%20March%202.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Ellisons%20and%20Paramount's%20other%20financial%20backers%20agreed%20to%20pay%20WBD%20investors%20%24650%20million%20per%20quarter%2C%20which%20is%20about%20%247%20million%20per%20day%2C%20that%20its%20merger%20isn't%20finalized%2C%20starting%20after%20September%2030.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20169%20days%20between%20October%201%20and%20March%2019%2C%20which%20is%20when%20Paramount's%20trial%20is%20scheduled%20to%20end.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20implies%20Paramount%20would%20owe%20WBD%20shareholders%20about%20%241.18%20billion%2C%20unless%20the%20company%20reaches%20a%20settlement%20with%20the%2012%20states%20suing%20to%20block%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstates-sue-paramount-skydance-warner-bros-discovery-deal-david-ellison-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eits%20deal%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20Paramount%20doesn't%20complete%20its%20merger%20with%20WBD%2C%20it%20would%20owe%20WBD%20a%20%247%20billion%20termination%20fee%20under%20the%20agreement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20Paramount%20spokesperson%20said%20in%20a%20statement%20the%20company%20would%20%26quot%3Brespect%20the%20court's%20decision%26quot%3B%20about%20the%20trial%20date.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2254394801-6d41-42d3-93a4-55ffc0a2fa1c%5C%22%3ESecond-quarter%20results%20were%20solid%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EParamount's%20second-quarter%20revenue%20and%20earnings%20came%20in%20slightly%20above%20the%20estimates%20of%20analysts%20surveyed%20by%20Bloomberg%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ERevenue%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%20%246.91%20billion%2C%20vs.%20est