3EWayne%20Ting%2C%20Lime's%20CEO%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider%20on%20Tuesday%20that%20the%20company%20is%20focused%20on%20getting%20more%20of%20its%20vehicles%20on%20the%20roads%20where%20it%20already%20operates%20rather%20than%20making%20a%20big%20push%20to%20expand%20to%20more%20cities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETing%20made%20the%20comments%20on%20the%20same%20day%20that%20Lime%20reported%20quarterly%20earnings%20results%20for%20the%20first%20time.%20Revenue%20grew%2024%25%20to%20%24304%20million%20for%20the%20second%20quarter%2C%20and%20the%20company%20posted%20net%20income%20of%20%24295%20million%2C%20including%20the%20benefits%20of%20its%20IPO%20in%20July.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShares%20of%20Lime%20rose%20about%202%25%20in%20after-hours%20trading.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EGetting%20riders%20to%20use%20Lime%20more%20frequently%20will%20be%20key%20to%20making%20the%20company%20consistently%20profitable%2C%20Ting%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELime%20operates%20in%20about%2060%20US%20cities.%20By%20adding%20more%20vehicles%20to%20its%20existing%20fleets%2C%20Ting%20said%2C%20Lime%20makes%20it%20easier%20for%20users%20to%20find%20a%20ride%20near%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20particularly%20important%20as%20Lime%20grows%20its%20paid%20subscription%20options%2C%20such%20as%20LimePass%2C%20which%20offers%20a%20discount%20on%20the%20company's%20usual%20per-minute%20rate%20if%20riders%20buy%20ahead%20of%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BYou're%20going%20to%20continue%20to%20see%20us%20invest%20in%20our%20existing%20markets%20to%20grow%20reliability%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BAnd%2C%20by%20growing%20reliability%2C%20we%20can%20also%20engage%20our%20riders%20more%20frequently.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELime's%20monthly%20active%20users%20grew%2022%25%20during%20its%20second%20quarter%2C%20topping%205%20million%20for%20the%20first%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETing%20said%20that%20Lime%20is%20%26quot%3Ban%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsteve-hanke-ai-not-destroying-jobs-unemployment-cost-data-centers-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI-resilient%3C%2Fa%3E%20business%2C%26quot%3B%20because%20it%20sells%20real-world%20rides%20on%20scooters%20and%20bikes.%20%26quot%3BThere's%20no%20amount%20of%20vibe-coding%20that%20is%20going%20to%20get%20you%20physical%20transportation%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20so%2C%20Lime%20is%20using%20AI%20in%20its%20operations%2C%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20uses%20a%20machine-learning%20algorithm%20to%20determine%20where%20to%20position%20scooters%20and%20bikes%20in%20each%20city%20based%20on%20demand%2C%20Ting%20said.%20The%20tech%20allows%20the%20company%20to%20%26quot%3Boptimize%20revenue%20or%20profits%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere's%20also%20a%20benefit%20for%20riders%2C%20Ting%20said%3A%20They're%20more%20likely%20to%20find%20a%20scooter%20or%20bike%20nearby%20when%20they%20need%20one.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BReliability%20is%20both%20the%20number%20of%20bikes%20and%20scooters%20you%20have%2C%20but%20it's%20also%20making%20sure%20they're%20at%20the%20right%20place%20at%20the%20right%20time%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDo%20you%20have%20a%20story%20idea%20about%20Lime%3F%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Aabitter%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Eabitter%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%20or%20via%20encrypted%20messaging%20app%20Signal%20at%20808-854-4501.%20Use%20a%20personal%20email%20address%2C%20a%20nonwork%20WiFi%20network%2C%20and%20a%20nonwork%20device%3B%20%3C%2Fem%3Ehere's%20our%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finsider-guide-to-securely-sharing-whistleblower-information-about-powerful-institutions-2021-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Eguide%20to%20sharing%20information%20securely%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E.%3C%2Fem