Army%20photo%20by%20Spc.%20Julian%20Winston%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20US%20task%20force%20for%20countering%20drones%20has%20unveiled%20a%20new%20marketplace%20for%20defensive%20technologies.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20shop%20built%20by%20Kaizen%20Laboratories%20lets%20users%20compare%20systems%2C%20performance%20data%2C%20and%20prices.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EUkraine%20operates%20a%20more%20established%20combat-technology%20marketplace%20called%20Brave1%20Market.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Pentagon's%20counter-drone%20task%20force%20and%20software%20company%20Kaizen%20Laboratories%20have%20developed%20a%20new%20online%20marketplace%20built%20to%20help%20users%20find%20and%20acquire%20systems%20for%20defending%20against%20uncrewed%20aerial%20systems.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20%26quot%3BCounter-Unmanned%20Aircraft%20Systems%20Marketplace%26quot%3B%20is%20a%20catalog%20that%20military%2C%20federal%20government%2C%20and%20law%20enforcement%20personnel%20can%20use%20to%20assess%20validated%20systems%2C%20from%20kinetic%20weapons%20to%20jammers%2C%20and%20submit%20requests%20to%20buy%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20an%20example%20of%20the%20Pentagon's%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Epush%20to%20make%20it%20faster%20and%20easier%20for%20troops%20and%20other%20government%20users%20to%20acquire%20commercially%20developed%20technology%20and%20get%20it%20into%20the%20field.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EKaizen%20was%20awarded%20a%20%2415%20million%20contract%20by%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-tests-new-autonomous-counter-drone-system-at-southern-border-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EJoint%20Interagency%20Task%20Force-401%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20May%20to%20build%20and%20operate%20the%20marketplace.%20The%20newly%20unveiled%20enhanced%20platform%20allows%20users%20to%20search%20systems%20by%20requirements%2C%20review%20performance%20data%2C%20compare%20capabilities%20and%20features%2C%20and%20purchase%20equipment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDefense%20officials%20have%20said%20that%20online%20shops%20like%20the%20C-UAS%20Marketplace%20help%20bypass%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-army-tearing-down-tech-walls-weapons-talk-each-other-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etraditional%20weapons%20acquisition%3C%2Fa%3E%20processes%20that%20can%20be%20slow%2C%20fragmented%2C%20and%20difficult%20for%20users%20to%20navigate.%20Companies%20have%20said%20the%20same.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThese%20are%20broken%2C%20disconnected%20application%20layer%20systems%20that%20are%20preventing%20real%20capability%20from%20being%20deployed%20at%20the%20edge%20as%20fast%20as%20possible%2C%20and%20as%20we%20all%20know%2C%20it's%20presenting%20a%20critical%20readiness%20problem%20for%20the%20armed%20forces%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Kaizen%20CEO%20Nikhil%20Reddy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EReddy%20told%20reporters%20last%20week%20that%20%26quot%3Bthreats%20are%20changing%20so%20quickly%2C%20but%20the%20systems%20that%20we%20actually%20have%2C%20the%20software%20layer%2C%20the%20application%20layer%20used%20to%20discover%2C%20evaluate%2C%20acquire%2C%20procure%20these%20systems%2C%20is%20so%20far%20behind%20what%20it%20needs%20to%20be.%20And%20operators%20are%20losing%20time%2C%20and%20in%20some%20cases%2C%20there's%20a%20loss%20of%20life%20if%20we%20can't%20move%20fast%20enough.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20US%20war%20with%20Iran%20has%20demonstrated%20the%20need%20for%20cheaper%20and%20more%20prolific%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fus-military-using-the-southern-border-test-counter-drone-tech-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecounter-UAS%20weapons%20and%20equipment%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Both%20American%20and%20allied%20forces%20have%20expended%20large%20numbers%20of%20expensive%20munitions%20shooting%20down%20Iranian%20Shahed%20drones.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIran's%20one-way%20attack%20drones%2C%20along%20with%20waves%20of%20missiles%2C%20have%20struck%20US%20and%20partner%20forces%2C%20resulting%20in%20both%20infrastructure%20damage%20and%20casualties.%20During%20the%20opening%20days%20of%20the%20war%2C%20six%20US%20soldiers%20were%20killed%20by%20a%20drone%20attack%20in%20Kuwait.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228192%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20small%20drone%20flies%20in%20a%20cloudy%20blue%20sky.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a51192d9d0a41df475c87c6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225464%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20marketplace%20is%20similar%20in%20function%20to%20Ukraine's%20Brave1%20Market.%3Cp%3EUS%20Marine%20Corps%20photo%20by%20Sgt.%20Iyer%20Ramakrishna%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThese%20attacks%2C%20along%20with%20the%20prevalence%20of%20drones%20in%20Russia's%20war%20against%20Ukraine%2C%20have%20underscored%20the%20need%20for%20layered%20defenses%20that%20can%20defeat%20these%20kinds%20of%20inexpensive%20threats%20without%20relying%20primarily%20on%20costly%20missiles.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BDrones%20are%20a%20defining%20threat%20of%20our%20time%2C%26quot%3B%20Brig.%20Gen.%20Matt%20Ross%2C%20director%20of%20JIATF-401%2C%20said%20in%20a%20press%20statement.%20%26quot%3BThe%20proliferation%20of%20small%20systems%20and%20small%20drones%20and%20the%20threat%20that%20they%20pose%20both%20to%20critical%20infrastructure%20and%20to%20defense%20critical%20assets%20requires%20us%20to%20move%20faster%20in%20this%20space.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIn%20order%20to%20address%20this%20threat%2C%20we%20are%20expanding%20the%20counter-UAS%20marketplace%20to%20allow%20us%20to%20share%20best%20practices%20and%20equipment%20globally%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20new%20enhanced%20C-UAS%20Marketplace%20features%20a%20library%20of%20forms%20and%20permits%2C%20and%20a%20planning%20tool%20through%20which%20users%20can%20describe%20a%20threat%2C%20identify%20systems%20that%20meet%20their%20needs%20and%20budget%2C%20and%20receive%20AI-generated%20recommendations%20%26quot%3Bacross%20all%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Farmy-anduril-strike-deal-linking-systems-to-counter-drones-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Easpects%20of%20the%20kill%20chain%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%26quot%3B%20Reddy%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20current%20platform%20went%20live%20two%20weeks%20ago%20and%20was%20built%20from%20a%20blank%20slate%20in%20less%20than%20nine%20weeks%2C%20he%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20said%20that%20some%20vendors%20with%20approved%20counter-UAS%20systems%2C%20such%20as%20Anduril%20and%20AeroVironment%2C%20have%20already%20put%20their%20products%20on%20the%20marketplace.%20Future%20vendors%20can%20send%20in%20product%20information%20for%20the%20task%20force's%20approval.%20US%20partners%20and%20allies%20will%20also%20be%20able%20to%20use%20the%20platform.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BJIATF-401%20remains%20focused%20on%20delivering%20the%20right%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraines-operation-spiderweb-provides-lessons-for-defending-us-bases-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecounter-UAS%20capabilities%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20the%20right%20users%20at%20the%20right%20time%2C%26quot%3B%20US%20Army%20Maj.%20Mike%20Hapner%2C%20JIATF-401's%20C-UAS%20marketplace%20lead%2C%20said%20in%20a%20press%20statement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOur%20revolutionary%20marketplace%2C%20powered%20through%20our%20partnership%20with%20industry%2C%20creates%20a%20streamlined%2C%20trusted%20pathway%20for%20the%20Joint%20Force%2C%20domestic%20law%20enforcement%2C%20and%20our%20international%20partners%20to%20rapidly%20discover%20and%20acquire%20validated%20technologies%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20counter-UAS%20shop%20bears%20some%20resemblance%20to%20Ukraine's%20combat%20technology%20marketplace%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraine-brave1-amazon-for-war-drones-eight-days-delivery-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EBrave1%20Market%3C%2Fa%3E%