iews.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20internal%20message%20suggests%20the%20tool%20will%20be%20replaced%20by%20informal%20discussions.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EMicrosoft%20is%20retiring%20a%20peer-feedback%20tool%20as%20it%20overhauls%20employee%20reviews%2C%20according%20to%20an%20internal%20message%20viewed%20by%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20tool%2C%20called%20Perspectives%2C%20allowed%20employees%20to%20request%20input%20on%20their%20performance%20from%20peers%20that%20would%20be%20visible%20to%20the%20employee%20and%20their%20managers.%20Microsoft%20has%20been%20using%20this%20tool%20since%202018.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20Perspectives%20tool%20is%20being%20retired%2C%26quot%3B%20the%20message%20says.%20%26quot%3BFeedback%20remains%20an%20important%20part%20of%20our%20growth%20mindset%2C%20and%20we%20heard%20from%20employees%20and%20managers%20that%20feedback%20is%20most%20valuable%20when%20shared%20through%20ongoing%2C%20in-the-moment%20conversations%20rather%20than%20formal%20requests.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20tool%20is%20no%20longer%20available%20for%20new%20feedback%20requests%2C%20though%20employees%20can%20respond%20to%20active%20requests%20and%20export%20feedback%20history%20until%20September%2015%2C%20according%20to%20the%20message.%20The%20message%20suggests%20the%20tool%20will%20be%20replaced%20by%20informal%20discussions%20with%20an%20employee's%20peers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20change%20comes%20as%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmicrosoft-plans-potential-rethink-performance-reviews-pivot-satya-nadella-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMicrosoft%20overhauls%20its%20performance%20review%3C%2Fa%3E%20system%2C%20simplifying%20ratings%20into%20five%20categories%20while%20making%20performance%20distinctions%20significantly%20sharper.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20the%20same%20time%2C%20managers%20have%20been%20instructed%20to%20reduce%20the%20number%20of%20employees%20in%20higher-level%20engineering%20roles%20as%20Microsoft%20continues%20flattening%20parts%20of%20the%20organization%2C%20emblematic%20of%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftech-industry-amazon-microsoft-meta-google-companies-intensity-hardcore-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ebroader%20hardcore%20work%20culture%3C%2Fa%3E%20that's%20spread%20across%20Big%20Tech%20in%20the%20last%20few%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Perspectives%20tool%20had%20replaced%20the%20company's%20previous%20Feedback%20Tool%2C%20which%20allowed%20managers%20to%20collect%2C%20review%2C%20and%20summarize%20peer%20feedback%20for%20employees.%20Perspectives%20was%20intended%20to%20be%20%26quot%3Bless%20intimidating%2C%26quot%3B%20as%20reported%20by%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fqz.com%2Fwork%2F1380162%2Fa-kinder-gentler-microsoft-is-replacing-feedback-with-perspectives%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EQuartz%20in%202022%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0as%20a%20sign%20of%20a%20%26quot%3Bkinder%2C%20gentler%20Microsoft.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20Microsoft%20human%20resources%20executive%20told%20Quartz%20at%20the%20time%20that%20Perspectives%20deliberately%20omitted%20the%20word%20%26quot%3Bfeedback%2C%26quot%3B%20which%20she%20said%20triggered%20negative%20impressions.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3EHave%20a%20tip%3F%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20via%20email%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Aastewart%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Eastewart%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3E%20or%20Signal%20at%20%2B1-425-344-8242.%20Use%20a%20personal%20email%20address%20and%20a%20nonwork%20device%3B%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Finsider-guide-to-securely-sharing-whistleblower-information-about-powerful-institutions-2021-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Ehere's%20