20the%20messages%20as%20part%20of%20its%20defense%20against%20Apple's%20trade%20secrets%20lawsuit.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EApple%20has%20accused%20OpenAI%20and%20former%20employees%20of%20stealing%20Apple's%20confidential%20information.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20notable%20detail%20to%20emerge%20from%20the%20brewing%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-openai-lawsuit-trade-secrets-changing-jobs-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Elegal%20battle%20between%20Apple%20and%20OpenAI%3C%2Fa%3E%20isn't%20about%20trade%20secrets%20at%20all%20%E2%80%94%20it's%20about%20workplace%20culture%20and%20internal%20AI%20use.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20series%20of%20iMessages%20released%20Tuesday%20as%20part%20of%20OpenAI's%20public%20response%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fapple-openai-trade-secret-claims-what-to-watch-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EApple's%20trade%20secrets%20lawsuit%3C%2Fa%3E%20against%20it%2C%20a%20former%20Apple%20engineer-turned-OpenAI%20staffer%20at%20the%20center%20of%20the%20case%20suggested%20that%20working%20at%20OpenAI%20was%20markedly%20different%20from%20working%20at%20Apple.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThis%20place%20is%20crazy%E2%80%A6%20hahahah%20we%20use%20Ai%20all%20over%20the%20place%2C%26quot%3B%20Chang%20Liu%20said%20in%20a%20text%20message%20to%20one%20of%20his%20former%20Apple%20colleagues%20shortly%20after%20he%20left%20the%20iPhone%20maker%20earlier%20this%20year%20to%20join%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fchatgpt%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EChatGPT%3C%2Fa%3E%20creator%20OpenAI.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELiu%2C%20who%20spent%20eight%20years%20at%20Apple%20as%20a%20senior%20system%20electrical%20engineer%20and%20is%20named%20among%20the%20defendants%20in%20Apple's%20lawsuit%2C%20said%20in%20another%20text%20made%20public%20by%20OpenAI%3A%20%26quot%3BThis%20startup%20style%20company%20is%20a%20funny%20and%20will%20be%20very%20hard%20in%20a%20couple%20months%F0%9F%98%81%F0%9F%98%81.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20messages%20offer%20a%20rare%20glimpse%20into%20one%20engineer's%20inside%20perspective%20on%20Apple%2C%20a%2050-year-old%20company%2C%20and%20OpenAI%2C%20a%20decade-old%20startup%2C%20as%20the%20tech%20companies%20race%20to%20build%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-smart-people-are-saying-about-apple-ai-announcements-wwdc-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Enext%20generation%20of%20AI%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20texts%20were%20among%20a%20collection%20of%20messages%20and%20emails%20that%20OpenAI%20published%20in%20a%20blog%20post%20titled%20%26quot%3BApple%20is%20getting%20this%20wrong%2C%26quot%3B%20as%20it%20defended%20itself%20against%20the%20company's%20lawsuit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22481%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Text%20messages%20released%20by%20OpenAI.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a7228624327cd5a0ae2ddf2%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22124%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOpenAI%20released%20text%20messages%20it%20said%20were%20from%20Chang%20Liu.%3Cp%3EOpenAI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EApple's%20federal%20lawsuit%20accuses%20OpenAI%2C%20along%20with%20Liu%20and%20Tang%20Tan%20%E2%80%94%20a%20former%20Apple%20employee%20and%20current%20OpenAI%20hardware%20chief%20%E2%80%94%20of%20stealing%20Apple's%20confidential%20information.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20lawsuit%20accuses%20the%20defendants%20of%20%26quot%3Bexploiting%20Apple's%20confidential%20information%20to%20advance%20OpenAI's%20efforts%20to%20enter%20the%20consumer%20hardware%20market.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20the%20Tuesday%20blog%20post%2C%20OpenAI%20slammed%20Apple's%20July%20lawsuit%20as%20%26quot%3Bcareless%2C%20aggressive%20and%20oddly%20personal%26quot%3B%20and%20said%2C%20%26quot%3BWe%20do%20not%20have%2C%20nor%20want%2C%20any%20of%20their%20trade%20secrets.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BApple%20accuses%20Chang%20Liu%20