3Elost%20a%20lawsuit%20against%20OpenAI%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20its%20leaders%20earlier%20this%20year%2C%20reposted%20screenshots%20of%20Apple's%20latest%20court%20filings%20on%20Tuesday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BCan't%20trust%20OpenAI%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Felonmusk%2Fstatus%2F2084652192024125768%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ewrote%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ENeil%20Cybart%2C%20Founder%20of%20Above%20Avalon%3Cp%3ENeil%20Cybart%2C%20the%20founder%20of%20the%20independent%20Apple%20analysis%20firm%20Above%20Avalon%2C%20dismissed%20OpenAI's%20response%20in%20a%20post%20on%20X.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20described%20the%20post%20as%20%26quot%3Bnonsensical%26quot%3B%20and%20accused%20OpenAI%20of%20using%20the%20classic%20%26quot%3Bhey%2C%20look%20over%20there%26quot%3B%20strategy%20to%20draw%20attention%20away%20from%20Apple's%20central%20allegations.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BOpenAI%20must%20be%20really%20nervous%20about%20Apple's%20trade%20secret%20theft%20lawsuit%20because%20this%20silly%20attempt%20at%20PR%20spin%20is%20nonsensical%2C%26quot%3B%20Cybart%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EJim%20Cramer%2C%20host%20of%20CNBC's%20%26quot%3BMad%20Money%26quot%3B%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225393%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Jim%20Cramer%20on%20a%20red%20carpet.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a7225143f00ff875d13c85c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223594%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EJim%20Cramer%20said%20Apple's%20new%20filing%20was%20%26quot%3Bgloves%20off.%26quot%3B%3Cp%3EJohn%20Nacion%2FVariety%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EJim%20Cramer%2C%20CNBC's%20host%20of%20%26quot%3BMad%20Money%2C%26quot%3B%20also%20commented%20on%20Apple's%20preliminary%20injunction%20in%20a%20post%20on%20X.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BGloves%20off%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fjimcramer%2Fstatus%2F2084545895966691630%5C%22%20targe