findia-indiatimes-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fuk%2Fover-170-migrants-rescued-after-channel-boat-catches-fire-uk-says-all-will-be-returned-to-france%2Famp_articleshow%2F132869264.cms%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fuk%2Fover-170-migrants-rescued-after-channel-boat-catches-fire-uk-says-all-will-be-returned-to-france%2Famp_articleshow%2F132869264.cms%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22TikTok's%20brief%20and%20raunchy%20experiment%20with%20a%20dating%20feature%20is%20over%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221920%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22TikTok%20has%20a%20%26quot%3Bdating%26quot%3B%20category%20on%20its%20livestreaming%20feed.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a7218dc97a2276a3423d26e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ETikTok%20tested%20a%20%26quot%3Bdating%26quot%3B%20option%20on%20its%20livestreaming%20feed.%3Cp%3EScreenshot%2FTikTok%2FBI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ETikTok%20is%20pausing%20a%20test%20of%20a%20new%20dating%20feature%20that%20connected%20singles%20in%20live%20chat%20rooms.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20feature%20lived%20in%20the%20%26quot%3Bhangout%26quot%3B%20part%20of%20the%20app%20and%20was%20one%20of%20several%20multi-guest%20live%20options.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ELivestream%20blind%20dates%20have%20become%20popular%20in%20China%2C%20where%20TikTok's%20owner%2C%20ByteDance%2C%20was%20founded.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20a%20brief%20moment%2C%20we%20looked%20for%20love%20in%20a%20hopeless%20place%3A%20TikTok.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETikTok%20tested%20a%20new%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbumble-launching-plans-paid-group-dating-feature-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Edating%20feature%3C%2Fa%3E%20over%20the%20past%20week%20that%20thrust%20users%20into%20live%20group%20chats%20with%20other%20singles.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20tool%20lived%20in%20a%20section%20of%20the%20app%20called%20%26quot%3Bhangout%26quot%3B%20that's%20tailored%20toward%20multi-guest%20experiences.%20It%20invited%20users%20who%20wanted%20to%20flirt%20to%20join%20chat%20rooms%20with%20%26quot%3Bgreat%20people%26quot%3B%20or%20%26quot%3Bawesome%20people%20to%20meet%2C%26quot%3B%20according%20to%20different%20versions%20of%20the%20feature%20viewed%20by%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETikTok's%20live%20dating%20option%2C%20which%20was%20made%20available%20to%20a%20subset%20of%20users%20in%20the%20US%20and%20a%20few%20other%20markets%2C%20is%20now%20being%20paused%2C%20a%20company%20spokesperson%20said%2C%20noting%20that%20TikTok%20often%20experiments%20with%20features%20that%20may%20not%20be%20broadly%20released.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDuring%20TikTok's%20brief%20dating%20stint%2C%20some%20of%20the%20chat%20rooms%20in%20the%20category%20seemed%20unrelated%20to%20courtship.%20Others%20viewed%20by%20Business%20Insider%20got%20raunchy.%20A%20user%20in%20one%20livestream%20encouraged%20viewers%20to%20comment%20in%20order%20to%20vibrate%20a%20%26quot%3Bcreator's%20XXL%20electric%20buttplug%2C%26quot%3B%20for%20example.%20Another%20chat%20room%20was%20looking%20for%20lesbians%20seeking%20%26quot%3Bbig%20beautiful%20women.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20experience%20felt%20like%20an%20uncanny%20hodgepodge%20of%20Tinder%2C%20Twitch%2C%20Clubhouse%2C%20and%20Omegle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETikTok's%20community%20guidelines%20limit%20livestream%20hosting%20to%20creators%20over%20the%20age%20of%2018.%20It%20won't%20recommend%20%26quot%3Brestricted%20content%26quot%3B%20to%20people%20between%20the%20ages%20of%2013%20and%2017%2C%20and%20the%20company%20spokesperson%20said%20users%20wouldn't%20have%20had%20dating%20livestreams%20recommended%20to%20them%20unless%20they'd%20already%20followed%20the%20host%20creator.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELive%20dating%20is%20one%20of%20several%20experiments%20happening%20on%20TikTok%2C%20which%20regularly%20tests%20ways%20to%20drive%20up%20engagement%20and%20expand%20into%20new%20businesses%20beyond%20standard%20short-form%20videos.%20The%20company%20operates%20a%20full-service%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftiktok-is-testing-an-amazon-prime-style-membership-program-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ee-commerce%20platform%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20is%20casting%20for%20actors%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftiktok-casting-actors-short-dramas-microdramas-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emake%20its%20own%20micro%20dramas%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20for%20instance.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221206%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Screenshot%20of%20TikTok%20%26quot%3Bconnecting%20you%20with%20great%20people...%26quot%3B%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a72196da62e6e00bc53a6ca%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22905%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ETikTok%20told%20users%20it%20was%20%26quot%3Bconnecting%20you%20with%20great%20people...%26quot%3B%20%E2%80%94%20then%20put%20them%20into%20a%20livestream.%3Cp%3EScreenshot%2FTikTok%2FBI%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ETikTok's%20push%20into%20dating%20may%20have%20been%20inspired%20by%20activity%20on%20its%20sister%20app%20in%20China%2C%20Douyin.%20Livestream%20blind%20dates%20have%20become%20increasingly%20popular%20in%20the%20country%2C%20where%20digital%20matchmakers%20host%20sessions%20for%20singles%20on%20Douyin%20and%20competitor%20apps%20like%20RedNote.%20Features%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhats-next-for-tiktok-look-at-china-douyin-2022-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etake%20off%20on%20Douyin%3C%2Fa%3E%20often%20end%20up%20on%20TikTok%20next.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOther%20US%20social-media%20platforms%20are%20also%20eyeing%20dating%20as%20a%20potential%20new%20business%20line.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFacebook%20launched%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffacebook-dating-app-ai-swipe-fatigue-assis