0of%20the%20sofa%20on%20each%20side.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EThe%20designer%20also%20avoids%20laminate%20floors%20in%20her%20home.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222121%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Floor%20samples%20lying%20on%20floor%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a720411a62e6e00bc53a4ff%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221414%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELaminate%20will%20never%20be%20as%20timeless%20as%20hardwood.%3Cp%3EUladzimir%20Zuyeu%2FGetty%20Images%2FiStockphoto%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIf%20you're%20lucky%20enough%20to%20purchase%20a%20home%20that%20has%20original%20flooring%2C%20absolutely%20do%20not%20replace%20it%20with%20laminate%20flooring%2C%26quot%3B%20Lang%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20the%20hardwood%20flooring%20needs%20a%20little%20love%2C%20you%20can%20have%20it%20refinished.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELang%20said%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.insider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fhow-to-clean-wood-floors%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Erefinishing%20hardwood%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20a%20manageable%20DIY%20project%20that%20will%20pay%20off%20in%20the%20long%20run.%20It%20can%20also%20add%20value%20to%20your%20home%20if%20you%20ever%20want%20to%20resell.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20story%20was%20originally%20published%20in%20January%202024%20and%20most%20recently%20updated%20on%20August%204%2C%202026.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cu%3EClick%20to%20keep%20reading%20other%20%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.insider.com%2Fcategory%2Finterior-designers-say%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cu%3Ethings%20interior%20designers%20say%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%3Cu%3E%20they%20would%20(or%20would%20never)%20have%20in%20their%20own%20space%3C%2Fu%3E.%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthings-i