several%20months%20ago%2C%20explaining%20why%20some%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstock-market-today-chip-memory-selloff-south-korea-kospi-index-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20stocks%20have%20sold%20off%3C%2Fa%3E%20sharply%20in%20recent%20weeks%20as%20investors%20rotate%20into%20other%20areas%20of%20the%20market.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EInvestors%20spent%20much%20of%20July%20rushing%20for%20the%20exits%20in%20memory%20and%20chip%20stocks.%20The%20Roundhill%20Memory%20ETF%20(DRAM)%20is%20down%2036%25%20from%20its%20recent%20peak%2C%20while%20the%20iShares%20Semiconductor%20ETF%20(SOXX)%20has%20fallen%2022%25%20from%20its%20recent%20high.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22custom%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Ciframe%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fdatawrapper.dwcdn.net%2FJ40QW%2F1%2F%5C%22%20title%3D%5C%22Performance%20of%20DRAM%20and%20SOXX%20year%20to%20date%5C%22%20data-external%3D%5C%221%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22439%5C%22%3E%3C%2Fiframe%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20the%20true%20danger%20lies%20ahead%20for%20smaller%20players%20in%20the%20AI%20trade%2C%20Damodaran%20said%2C%20as%20those%20companies%20lack%20the%20financial%20buffers%20needed%20to%20weather%20the%20coming%20decline%20in%20the%20AI%20trade.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BMy%20bet%20is%20that%20we%20hit%20peak%20AI%20a%20few%20months%20ago%2C%20and%20that%20there%20will%20be%20more%20consolidation%20and%20correction%20in%20the%20months%20ahead%2C%26quot%3B%20Damodaran%20said.%20%26quot%3BI%20think%20when%20you%20see%20a%20shakeout%20in%20the%20AI%20space%2C%20it's%20not%20so%20much%20the%20Mag%20Seven%20we%20should%20be%20watching%2C%20but%20the%20lesser%20companies.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAI%20firms%20have%20started%20to%20rebound%20as%20investors%20pile%20back%20into%20beaten-down%20tech%20stocks.%20The%20Dow%20and%20S%26amp%3BP%20500%20hit%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstock-market-today-dow-sp500-nasdaq-record-highs-026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efresh%20records%3C%2Fa%3E%20this%20week%2C%20thanks%20largely%20to%20a%20risk-on%20move%20as%20investors%20rotate%20back%20into%20tech.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20move%20higher%20is%20largely%20due%20to%20FOMO%20rather%20than%20fundamentals%2C%20Damodaran%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BPeople%20say%2C%20'Hey%2C%20now%20I%20have%20a%20chance%20to%20have%20an%20AI%20company%20in%20the%20space.'%20I%20wouldn't%20put%20it%20deeper%20than%20that%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDamodaran%20called%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhyperscalers-cant-win-with-investors-ai-spending-capex-alphabet-earnings-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehyperscalers%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20the%20cluster%20of%20tech%20giants%20that%20spend%20the%20most%20on%20AI%20%E2%80%94%20the%20%26quot%3Bmost%20protected%26quot%3B%20companies%20in%20the%20space%2C%20due%20to%20abundant%20cash%20flow%20and%20the%20ability%20to%20carry%20large%20amounts%20of%20debt.%20Still%2C%20he%20raised%20concerns%20that%20large%20AI%20companies%20were%20becoming%20more%20indebted%20while%20seeing%20a%20low%20return%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fjim-paulsen-wall-street-ai-capex-boom-earnings-stocks-economy-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAI%20capex%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BUnless%20they%20start%20delivering%20earnings%20commensurate%20with%20the%20tens%20of%20billions%20of%20invested%20in%20capex%2C%20you're%20going%20to%20see%20a%20very%20different%20kind%20of%20company%20emerging%20from%20the%20mix%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BNothing%20wrong%20with%20that%2C%20but%20I%20think%20investors%20in%20these%20companies%20are%20not%20used%20to%20what%20the%20risks%20are%20of%20investing%20in%20a%20more%20capital-intensive%20company.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDamodaran%20has%20regularly%20warned%20that%20some%20compa